Third-Party Components
======================

This repository bundles or vendors the following third-party components, each
of which is distributed under its own license:

* cJSON (samples/third_party/cJSON/)
    Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Dave Gamble and cJSON contributors
    MIT License — see samples/third_party/cJSON/LICENSE

* libmosquitto / libssl / libcrypto pre-built binaries
    (samples/third_party/aarch64/lib/)
    These are unmodified upstream binaries:
      libmosquitto       Eclipse Public License v2.0 / EDL v1.0
      libssl / libcrypto OpenSSL License / SSLeay License (or Apache-2.0 for 3.x)
    See each upstream project for the full text.
